commit 46965384
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 15:51:43 -0600
subject: fix(models): add descriptive error logging to buildModelsList try/catch blocks

GAP-P2-32: Replace 5 generic console.log messages with console.warn
that includes the function name and e.message for each catch block.
Enables debugging of provider/combos/customModels/aliases/disabled
fetch failures instead of silent swallowing.


